OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess is joined by conductor Harry
OL,6,     GChristophers to swap the music
OL,7,     Gthey love the most, with bouncing
OL,8,     Gtracks by Abel Selaocoe and
OL,9,     GBeyonce, and an aching finale by
OL,10,     GMahler.
OL,11,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,12,     GAriodante from the Royal Ballet
OL,13,     Gand Opera, the site of its
OL,14,     Gpremiere during Handel's first
OL,15,     GCovent Garden season in 1735.
OL,16,     GStarring Emily D'Angelo and
OL,17,     GJacquelyn Stucker.
