OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,5,     GKathryn Tickell invites the Irish
OL,6,     Gvocal group Landless to paint a
OL,7,     Gsonic portrait of Dublin in three
OL,8,     Gtracks; and plays Congolese
OL,9,     Grumba, Catalan songs, and Greek-
OL,10,     GAnatolian laments.
OL,11,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,12,     GKate Molleson presents exclusive
OL,13,     Grecordings including Alex
OL,14,     GPaxton's Shrimp BIT Babyface.
OL,15,     GContains some strong language.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GAndras Schiff performs Bach's The
OL,18,     GArt of Fugue, which he described
OL,19,     Gas 'the greatest work by the
OL,20,     Ggreatest composer who ever
OL,21,     Glived.' From the 2025 BBC Proms
OL,22,     Gat the Royal Albert Hall.
